    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a green alien of an unnamed species, embarking on a dangerous journey to reach the summit of the northern mountains \u2014 a rite of passage in your culture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with nothing but your wits, you must avoid threats lurking in every corner. Fortunately, mysterious power-ups and ancient devices are scattered throughout the land to aid you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I like to describe the game as a new take on the maze genre \u2014 you are unarmed, and survival depends entirely on navigation, power-ups, and timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level consists of five areas, with the fifth area being a boss fight. Levels are accessed through a central world map, and new levels unlock as you complete previous ones.<br><br>As a personal initiative, I\u2019ve decided to donate 25% of my earnings from this game to humanitarian relief efforts in Gaza, via the Danish Red Cross (R\u00f8de Kors Danmark). Read more here:  <br></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a green alien of an unnamed species, embarking on a dangerous journey to reach the summit of the northern mountains \u2014 a rite of passage in your culture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with nothing but your wits, you must avoid threats lurking in every corner. Fortunately, mysterious power-ups and ancient devices are scattered throughout the land to aid you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I like to describe the game as a new take on the maze genre \u2014 you are unarmed, and survival depends entirely on navigation, power-ups, and timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level consists of five areas, with the fifth area being a boss fight. Levels are accessed through a central world map, and new levels unlock as you complete previous ones.<br><br>As a personal initiative, I\u2019ve decided to donate 25% of my earnings from this game to humanitarian relief efforts in Gaza, via the Danish Red Cross (R\u00f8de Kors Danmark). Read more here:  <br></p>",
    "short_description": "Embark on an epic journey filled with monsters and mysterious collectibles in this retro maze game",
